    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-counters-p06-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "脸: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "In 一脸 + substance, 脸 borrows the face as a measure for what covers it. It is not an additional person or a count of faces.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他一脸水。",
                "pinyin": "tā yī liǎn shuǐ 。",
                "meaning": "His face is covered in water.",
                "audio": "89ae027da128271c6fe4ba6131f83a2de509537dfdaec4527bff204c0a531070"
              },
              {
                "text": "我也一脸水。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yě yī liǎn shuǐ 。",
                "meaning": "My face is covered in water too.",
                "audio": "8ee58a5359da7ae36a226dcfcf705a980e88e0ec631f04bd7bad6b93e30407ee"
              }
            ]
